config WAVESHARE_DSI_4P3_MCU
	bool "Waveshare 4.3\" MIPI-DSI panel with on-board MCU"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_WAVESHARE_DSI_4P3_MCU_ENABLED
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Driver for the Waveshare 4.3" MIPI-DSI display with on-board MCU
	  (800x480). The MCU exposes an I2C register set for power, enable,
	  brightness at address 0x45; register layout is distinct from the
	  bare ICN6211 handled by WAVESHARE_DSI2DPI. Intended to be driven
	  by a host display controller (e.g. infineon,pse84-gfxss); the
	  panel node is typically marked 'zephyr,deferred-init' so the host
	  can run the panel init with device_init() after the DSI link is up.
